### Global CSS

To customize the Toast component classes, you can use the `@layer components` directive.
[Learn more](https://tailwindcss.com/docs/adding-custom-styles#adding-component-classes).

```css
@layer components {
  .toast {
    @apply rounded-xl shadow-lg;
  }

  .toast__content {
    @apply gap-2;
  }
}
```

